  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government is currently implementing a series of strategic initiatives to bolster national food security. Coordinating Minister for Food Zulkifli Hasan has been actively supervising the distribution of rice aid and advocating for the expansion of thematic protein areas across 40,000 village locations. These efforts are part of a broader push to reach food self-sufficiency at the local level. In addition to direct distribution overseen by agencies like Bulog, the government is collaborating with higher education institutions to enhance research and agricultural productivity. Private and state-owned financial institutions are also participating by strengthening food-related ecosystems. These combined efforts aim to improve supply chain efficiency and ensure that humanitarian and government food aid programs are distributed effectively to the intended recipients throughout the country.",
